(#907).  It is populated by Orcs and Shaman Uga-Buga Makumb Stuffy doll 
rules there.  Their Orcish warriors array themselves as Phalanx and 
Warg Riders.  I discovered a feature in the Third Sea: a Magic Pool (#105) 
occupied by the Giant Octopus.  Legend says the Huge Hoard of Gold is hidden 
here.  The Giant Octopus is a strong terror of the deep, which can grip 
entire ships in its arms and wrestle it to its watery grave.

  Thy humble servant,   Reynald


From: Frodo, Squire to Gabriel
To: Circe

  Honored Sovereign, 

  With the coming of the spring season, Gabriel prepared to quench his 
thirst for glory.  He cruised over to the Silver Sea.  Gabriel encountered 
no marauding monster.
  The wet spring was followed by early summer.  Gabriel travelled to the 
Constitution Sea.  During his travels, he was crossing an open field when an 
Elemental Sorceror spotted Gabriel from a distance.  He hailed 
the Elemental Sorceror with friendly words, and combat was avoided.

  In late summer, Philo could find no soldiers in the Constitution Sea for 
the requested Light Cavalry troops.  Instead, Philo practiced his Meleeing 
