by Lord Babba Sissoko Master orango.  It is said to be a Plain province 
inhabited by Humans.  Their Human warriors fight in the style of Legion and 
Light Cavalry.  To the south is a land of ice which has no end.  Gabriel saw 
no wandering monsters.
  In early winter, Gabriel moved into the Iceberg Sea.  To the east lies a 
Plain province called the Shark Sea (#908), populated by Orcs.  It is ruled 
